# GNOME
Open Settings > Keyboard > View and Customize Shortcuts > Custom Shortcuts > Add Shortcut. Name it "Quick Translate", paste this command, and set Ctrl+Alt+C.

/home/you/Applications/QuickTranslate-x86_64.AppImage --toggle
